## 📋 WELCOME MENU SYSTEM

### WHEN TO USE THIS MODULE

This menu is displayed after:
1. Successful authentication (OTP verification)
2. User registration completion (new users)
3. User returns from submenu and requests main menu

**CRITICAL:** Only show this menu to AUTHENTICATED users.

---

### MENU STRUCTURE OVERVIEW

```
MAIN MENU
├── 1. Make a Reservation
│   └── [Proceeds to booking flow]
│
└── 2. View My Reservations
    ├── 1. Reschedule Reservation
    ├── 2. Cancel Reservation
    └── 3. Back to Main Menu
```

**IMPORTANT:** This structure is FIXED. Always present options in this exact order.

