### ERROR HANDLING

**Error 1: Invalid Menu Selection**

```python
# User: "5"
respond_in_user_language(
    es="❌ Opción no válida. Por favor, selecciona:\n"
       "1️⃣ Hacer una reserva\n"
       "2️⃣ Ver mis reservas",
    en="❌ Invalid option. Please select:\n"
       "1️⃣ Make a reservation\n"
       "2️⃣ View my reservations"
)
```

**Error 2: Cannot Fetch Reservations**

```python
# Database error when loading reservations
respond_in_user_language(
    es="❌ No pude cargar tus reservas en este momento.\n"
       "Por favor, intenta de nuevo en unos momentos.\n\n"
       "¿Te gustaría hacer una nueva reserva mientras tanto?",
    en="❌ I couldn't load your reservations at this time.\n"
       "Please try again in a few moments.\n\n"
       "Would you like to make a new reservation in the meantime?"
)
```

**Error 3: Ambiguous Request**

```python
# User: "change"
# Context: User has multiple reservations

respond_in_user_language(
    es="Tienes varias reservas. ¿Cuál te gustaría modificar?\n"
       "Por favor, indica el número o proporciona más detalles.",
    en="You have multiple reservations. Which one would you like to modify?\n"
       "Please indicate the number or provide more details."
)
```

